      "side": 1,
      "message": "Short answer: `platform/ec $ ./twister -T zephyr/test`.\n\nYou can see more details about running twister at https://docs.zephyrproject.org/3.1.0/develop/test/twister.html. `platform/ec` has a symlink to the tool, but the configuration stuff is basically the same. You definitely don\u0027t need to read that whole document. `-T` says to run all the tests in a directory. `-s` says to run a particular test build with syntax described by `--help`. `twister` takes few seconds to do anything when you start it. It\u0027s not dead. 😊\n\nThe existing tests are under `platform/ec/zephyr/test`.",
