      "message": "Sorry about the delay to look this further. I was busy with other priority tasks, as this change was relevant to RVP only and later was on vacation.\nTried experimenting with pd_set_dual_role() to set dual role as FORCE_SRC at different existing test places under zephyr/test/.\nBut, it don\u0027t seem to getting into right pd states as pd_update_dual_role_config() is getting updated \u0026 causing test failures.\nWithout adding any new test cases, On  just returning  pd_get_drp_state_in_s0() as force_source is seeming to help hit the coverage for these code line changes in verify_no_vconn_swap test under test suite \u0027usbc_ctvpd\u0027. So i have overwritten the default  dual role in S0 just for this file. Also, Even afterchanging the default dual role -toggle_ON to force_source, this test suite is a pass. So, i didn\u0027t further try adding any new test case.\nDo you think, overriding function just for this test is ok, so that this CL can get merged? Infact , i am also wondering on, if this overriding function change must fall under board specific change ?",
